%% End-to-End Loan Lifecycle
flowchart LR
Reg[Registration] --> Login[Authenticate]
Login --> Apply[Submit PENDING application]
Apply --> Review[Officer review]
Review -->|Approve| Approved[APPROVED + create loan]
Review -->|Reject| Rejected[REJECTED]
Approved --> Disburse[Record disbursement]
Disburse --> Active[ACTIVE]
Active --> Repay[Record repayments]
Repay -->|balance > 0| Active
Repay -->|balance = 0| Complete[COMPLETED]
Approved -. LOAN_APPROVED .-> Chain[Contract events]
Rejected -. LOAN_REJECTED .-> Chain
Disburse -. LOAN_DISBURSED .-> Chain
Repay -. REPAYMENT_RECORDED .-> Chain
Complete -. LOAN_COMPLETED .-> Chain
